{"step_index":221,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T04:52:44Z","thinking":"**Adding Interactive Feedback**\n\nI'm currently focused on implementing interactive feedback animations within `js/app.js`. Level 1 details are being tackled now. Soft item interactions trigger `burstStarsAt`, the tile receives a `worn` state, a corresponding badge gets checked. The Bin sprite will celebrate with a `celebrate-bounce` animation, providing visual affirmation.\n\n\n**Expanding Interaction Logic**\n\nI've been fleshing out more interactive elements. Level 2 now includes animations for packing the suitcase with a `.packed-bounce` and sounds, plus shaking wobbles for `ASK_PARENT` and `LEAVE_HOME`. I've added a few animations for level 3, which involve stamping, x-ray blocks, and the gate. I'm exploring sounds for each level as well, while expanding on the interactive feedback. I also have animations and sounds set for levels 4 and 5. I am continuing to add animations to the new levels.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"/**\\n * app.js - Main Controller for \\\"Cùng Bé Bin Đi Máy Bay\\\" (8 Levels)\\n * Tích hợp toàn diện hiệu ứng tương tác sinh động, âm thanh và chuyển động phản hồi\\n */\\n\\nclass KidFlightApp {\\n    constructor() {\\n        this.currentScreen = 1;\\n        this.totalScreens = 8;\\n        this.maxUnlockedLevel = 1;\\n        \\n        // Ngăn chặn duplicate event listeners khi quay lại màn\\n        this.levelInitialized = {\\n            1: false, 2: false, 3: false, 4: false,\\n            5: false, 6: false, 7: false, 8: false\\n        };\\n\\n        // Trạng thái các Level\\n        this.level1Dressed = { shirt: false, pants: false, shoes: false };\\n        this.level2Packed = 0;\\n        this.level3Steps = { checkin: false, xrayCount: 0, gate: false };\\n        this.level4Completed = false;\\n        this.level5Belt = { inserted: false, earRelieved: false };\\n        this.level6Clouds = { c1: false, c2: false, c3: false, c4: false };\\n        this.level7Tasks = { volume: false, leg: false };\\n        this.level8State = { planeStopped: false, unbuckled: false, baggage: false };\\n\\n        this.parentHoldStart = 0;\\n        this.parentHoldReqId = null;\\n\\n        this.init();\\n    }\\n\\n    init() {\\n        this.bindGlobalEvents();\\n        this.initLevel(1);\\n        this.showScreen(1);\\n    }\\n\\n    // --- PARENT PROMPT API (HIỂN THỊ CÂU THOẠI TRÊN BIỂN BÁO BA MẸ ĐỌC) ---\\n    showParentPrompt(speaker, text) {\\n        if (window.dialogueMgr) {\\n            window.dialogueMgr.show(speaker, text);\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    // --- NAVIGATION & STAGE LOCKING CONTROLLER ---\\n    unlockLevel(levelNum) {\\n        if (levelNum > this.maxUnlockedLevel && levelNum <= this.totalScreens) {\\n            this.maxUnlockedLevel = levelNum;\\n            const dot = document.querySelector(`.stage-dot[data-screen=\\\"${levelNum}\\\"]`);\\n            if (dot) {\\n                dot.classList.remove('locked');\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    showScreen(screenNum) {\\n        if (s\n<truncated 40726 bytes>","Description":"\"Đồng bộ đầy đủ hiệu ứng tương tác click, drag, particle feedback vào app.js\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"c:\\\\Demo.plane\\\\js\\\\app.js\"","toolAction":"\"Writing file\"","toolSummary":"\"Update app.js with interactive visual effects\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
