{"step_index":233,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T04:57:00Z","thinking":"**Confirming Visual Assets**\n\nOkay, the first phase is complete. I've successfully generated the initial two SVG assets: `bin_blue_unbuckled` and `bin_yellow_unbuckled`. They are standalone, crystal sharp, and located as specified. Now, I will start to generate the remaining two combinations.\n\n\n**Designing State Manager**\n\nI'm now fully immersed in developing the character state manager in `js/app.js`, crafting the `updateCharacterImage()` method as the core. The initial logic for selecting the correct SVG asset based on `shirtColor` and `seatbelt` state has been fully implemented, and I am preparing for integration.\n\n\n**Implementing State Methods**\n\nI've added the `setShirtColor()` and `setSeatbelt()` methods to manage character state, triggering image updates and sound effects, and updating the UI accordingly. I'm now integrating these methods into the relevant UI components of levels 1 and 5, specifically linking color buttons to color changes and buckle interactions to seatbelt adjustments. I'm also preparing for the sound effects.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"vi\\\">\\n<head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=3.0, user-scalable=yes, viewport-fit=cover\\\">\\n    <title>Cùng Bé Bin Đi Máy Bay (Parent-Co-Play Interactive Book)</title>\\n    <!-- Offline font fallback stack & Google Font -->\\n    <link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\\\">\\n    <link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\\\" crossorigin>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@700;800;900&display=swap\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\">\\n    <link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"css/style.css\\\">\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n    <div id=\\\"app-root\\\">\\n        <!-- Canvas Pháo hoa, Sao lấp lánh & Trái tim -->\\n        <canvas id=\\\"effects-canvas\\\"></canvas>\\n\\n        <!-- TOP BAR: 8 LEVEL DOTS & CỔNG BA MẸ -->\\n        <header class=\\\"top-nav\\\">\\n            <nav class=\\\"stage-indicators\\\" aria-label=\\\"Tiến trình chuyến bay\\\">\\n                <button class=\\\"stage-dot active\\\" data-screen=\\\"1\\\" aria-label=\\\"Level 1: Mặc đồ\\\">👕</button>\\n                <button class=\\\"stage-dot locked\\\" data-screen=\\\"2\\\" aria-label=\\\"Level 2: Xếp vali\\\">🧳</button>\\n                <button class=\\\"stage-dot locked\\\" data-screen=\\\"3\\\" aria-label=\\\"Level 3: Kiểm tra an ninh\\\">🎫</button>\\n                <button class=\\\"stage-dot locked\\\" data-screen=\\\"4\\\" aria-label=\\\"Level 4: Tìm Cổng Bay\\\">🚪</button>\\n                <button class=\\\"stage-dot locked\\\" data-screen=\\\"5\\\" aria-label=\\\"Level 5: Hiệp sĩ đai\\\">🦸</button>\\n                <button class=\\\"stage-dot locked\\\" data-screen=\\\"6\\\" aria-label=\\\"Level 6: Ngắm mây\\\">☁️</button>\\n                <button class=\\\"stage-dot locked\\\" data-screen=\\\"7\\\" aria-label=\\\"Level 7: Lịch sự\\\">🤫</button>\\n                <button class=\\\"stage-dot locked\\\" data-screen=\\\"8\\\" aria-label=\\\"Level 8: Nhận vali & Thưởng\\\">🏆</button>\\n            </nav>\\n\\n            <!-- Cổng Ba M\n<truncated 29968 bytes>","Description":"\"Cập nhật index.html với hệ thống Bé Bin thay đổi hình ảnh động theo lựa chọn\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"c:\\\\Demo.plane\\\\index.html\"","toolAction":"\"Writing file\"","toolSummary":"\"Update index.html for dynamic character states\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
