{"step_index":237,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T04:57:51Z","thinking":"**Defining Character State**\n\nI'm currently focused on defining the initial character state within `js/app.js`. Specifically, I'm setting `this.characterState` with default shirt colors (\"yellow\" or \"blue\") and seatbelt status. I am then planning to integrate the `updateCharacterImage()` function to respond to changes in the `shirtColor` and `seatbelt` parameters.\n\n\n**Mapping Assets Dynamically**\n\nI've mapped the character states to four distinct SVG assets, each representing a combination of shirt color (\"yellow\" or \"blue\") and seatbelt status (buckled or unbuckled). The application will use these to dynamically update the `.bin-dynamic-avatar` image elements. I'm focusing on immediate visual feedback, triggering a `pop-in` animation upon each state change.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"/**\\n * app.js - Main Controller for \\\"Cùng Bé Bin Đi Máy Bay\\\" (8 Levels)\\n * Dynamic Character State Logic:\\n * - shirtColor: 'yellow' | 'blue'\\n * - seatbelt: true | false\\n * - updateCharacterImage(): Thay đổi trực tiếp 4 hình ảnh theo tương tác học sinh\\n */\\n\\nclass KidFlightApp {\\n    constructor() {\\n        this.currentScreen = 1;\\n        this.totalScreens = 8;\\n        this.maxUnlockedLevel = 1;\\n        \\n        // Trạng thái nhân vật Bé Bin (4 State Matrix)\\n        this.characterState = {\\n            shirtColor: 'yellow', // 'yellow' | 'blue'\\n            seatbelt: false        // true | false\\n        };\\n\\n        // Ngăn chặn duplicate event listeners khi quay lại màn\\n        this.levelInitialized = {\\n            1: false, 2: false, 3: false, 4: false,\\n            5: false, 6: false, 7: false, 8: false\\n        };\\n\\n        // Trạng thái các Level\\n        this.level1Dressed = { shirt: false, pants: false, shoes: false };\\n        this.level2Packed = 0;\\n        this.level3Steps = { checkin: false, xrayCount: 0, gate: false };\\n        this.level4Completed = false;\\n        this.level5Belt = { inserted: false, earRelieved: false };\\n        this.level6Clouds = { c1: false, c2: false, c3: false, c4: false };\\n        this.level7Tasks = { volume: false, leg: false };\\n        this.level8State = { planeStopped: false, unbuckled: false, baggage: false };\\n\\n        this.parentHoldStart = 0;\\n        this.parentHoldReqId = null;\\n\\n        this.init();\\n    }\\n\\n    init() {\\n        this.bindGlobalEvents();\\n        this.updateCharacterImage(); // Khởi tạo hình Bé Bin đúng theo state ban đầu\\n        this.initLevel(1);\\n        this.showScreen(1);\\n    }\\n\\n    // ==========================================================================\\n    // DYNAMIC CHARACTER STATE ENGINE (HÀM CỐT LÕI THEO YÊU CẦU)\\n    // ==========================================================================\\n    updateCharacterImage() {\\n        const { shirtColor\n<truncated 43269 bytes>","Description":"\"Cập nhật app.js với hệ thống dynamic state engine và hàm updateCharacterImage()\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"c:\\\\Demo.plane\\\\js\\\\app.js\"","toolAction":"\"Writing file\"","toolSummary":"\"Update app.js with dynamic character states\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
