{"step_index":243,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T06:15:45Z","thinking":"**Defining Clothing Assets**\n\nI'm currently focused on defining clothing assets within the directory `assets/characters/bin/dress/`. Specifically, I've outlined six SVG files: `shirt_yellow.svg`, `shirt_blue.svg`, `pants_orange.svg`, `pants_blue.svg`, and `shoes_blue_velcro.svg`. This is the first step in creating a modular clothing system.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"<svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 400 600\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\">\\n  <defs>\\n    <linearGradient id=\\\"yellowHoodieL\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" y1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"0\\\" y2=\\\"1\\\">\\n      <stop offset=\\\"0%\\\" stop-color=\\\"#FFF59D\\\"/>\\n      <stop offset=\\\"100%\\\" stop-color=\\\"#FDD835\\\"/>\\n    </linearGradient>\\n  </defs>\\n\\n  <!-- Áo Hoodie Vàng (Layer Trong Suốt) -->\\n  <g id=\\\"layer-shirt-yellow\\\">\\n    <!-- Thân áo hoodie -->\\n    <rect x=\\\"110\\\" y=\\\"220\\\" width=\\\"180\\\" height=\\\"155\\\" rx=\\\"36\\\" fill=\\\"url(#yellowHoodieL)\\\" stroke=\\\"#F57F17\\\" stroke-width=\\\"5\\\"/>\\n    <!-- Túi kangaroo trước bụng -->\\n    <path d=\\\"M 140 305 Q 200 325 260 305 L 250 355 L 150 355 Z\\\" fill=\\\"#FFF9C4\\\" stroke=\\\"#FBC02D\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\"/>\\n    <!-- Dây rút mũ hoodie -->\\n    <path d=\\\"M 175 225 Q 170 260 175 275\\\" stroke=\\\"#FFFFFF\\\" stroke-width=\\\"5\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n    <path d=\\\"M 225 225 Q 230 260 225 275\\\" stroke=\\\"#FFFFFF\\\" stroke-width=\\\"5\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n    \\n    <!-- Ống tay áo hoodie -->\\n    <rect x=\\\"70\\\" y=\\\"240\\\" width=\\\"44\\\" height=\\\"90\\\" rx=\\\"22\\\" transform=\\\"rotate(15 70 240)\\\" fill=\\\"url(#yellowHoodieL)\\\" stroke=\\\"#F57F17\\\" stroke-width=\\\"4\\\"/>\\n    <rect x=\\\"285\\\" y=\\\"240\\\" width=\\\"44\\\" height=\\\"90\\\" rx=\\\"22\\\" transform=\\\"rotate(-15 285 240)\\\" fill=\\\"url(#yellowHoodieL)\\\" stroke=\\\"#F57F17\\\" stroke-width=\\\"4\\\"/>\\n  </g>\\n</svg>\\n\"","Description":"\"Tạo layer Áo Hoodie Vàng (shirt_yellow.svg)\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"c:\\\\Demo.plane\\\\assets\\\\characters\\\\bin\\\\dress\\\\shirts\\\\shirt_yellow.svg\"","toolAction":"\"Writing file\"","toolSummary":"\"Create yellow hoodie layer svg\""}}]}
